</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="bench__llm__hotpaths_8cpp" kindref="compound">benchmarks/llm/bench_llm_hotpaths.cpp</ref> — LLM-01..LLM-08 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</sect1>
